The cafe is completely full.
There are many people here.
I see an empty place.
My bag is in my hand.
I hold the bag properly.
There is a table near the window.
That table is small.
One chair there is empty.
I quickly go there.
I sit on the chair.
I place my bag nearby.
Nearby an old man reads a newspaper.
He is calm.
I also become calm.
This seat is comfortable.
The street is visible from the window.
This spot is just right.
Now I am waiting for my tea.
